{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Second Installment of <i><strong>(The Lingering)</strong></i> Series. <strong>Welcome to <i>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> is an episodic atmospheric horror series, inspired by <strong>true horror events</strong> and <strong>urban legends in Indonesia</strong>. Each episode tells the unsettling stories of those who cross paths with the lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit</i></strong>, play as <strong>Eki</strong>, an 11-year-old boy visiting his late father\u2019s grave with his mother. There, he meets <strong>Tomy</strong>, a local boy who seems to know a lot about the village, including the dark rumors surrounding the sacrificial ritual, a wealth-seeking ritual said to involve sacrificing a child\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by doubt, Eki begins to suspect that this graveyard visit might be somewhat related to the ritual, especially knowing his mother has been struggling financially since his father\u2019s death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who should you trust? Your mother, or Tomy? Play now to find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit is an episodic, narrative-driven, walking sim horror game where you play as Eki, exploring a remote graveyard while uncovering unsettling truths about the child sacrifice ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a narrative-driven, walking sim with light puzzle elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PSX graphics: a love letter to the retro gaming era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a true story: every episode comes from a real submission by our community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Sometimes, your actions will result in different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Indonesian cultural aspect: the setting, myth, and ritual are all drawn from real Indonesian folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist in the story.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/dbb51a3266f59721951145ea28671ab6a471511d.jpg"},{"name":"Under Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/80ad9aa851d3df5a606415ea030a64ab83f2b497.jpg"},{"name":"Something's Wrong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/1013a54de3bbbf442b2de2ef3004dc6d74889361.jpg"},{"name":"Caught in Action","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/a229de4db4cd6992c4599c74e75aa4d852db8e83.jpg"},{"name":"Repeating Mistakes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/8655e1588463984850bfcff5fb9cf1f5044baf19.jpg"},{"name":"Finally, the Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/01f6aa8bed77756a4267bacf90ac067efc9d65be.jpg"},{"name":"Detour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/37ac276d34705580c4f0441d1ea970424ad06321.jpg"},{"name":"Town Gossip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/a679a0f5e8358edd923d3a1fa726fced7cba11f8.jpg"},{"name":"The Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/9c3e4318e1f48b87312c9a9ce857e2fbedb9dc8d.jpg"},{"name":"Brave Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/3be756d5e89d56c7d9c8ea788933400136ab864f.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3731150?t=1752670859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/946a76b5c2e3c0329d86edf1fbed58a52c20239d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752670859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/3a7db4971af1ee4e29ac6a0cd4d6f3a2e8124224/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752670859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/3a7db4971af1ee4e29ac6a0cd4d6f3a2e8124224/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752670859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/c4e6eaaaa6a66fc06328473229b9c462.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Second Installment of <i><strong>(The Lingering)</strong></i> Series. <strong>Welcome to <i>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> is an episodic atmospheric horror series, inspired by <strong>true horror events</strong> and <strong>urban legends in Indonesia</strong>. Each episode tells the unsettling stories of those who cross paths with the lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/99b04e393048ae633725f988c62d538d.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit</i></strong>, play as <strong>Eki</strong>, an 11-year-old boy visiting his late father\u2019s grave with his mother. There, he meets <strong>Tomy</strong>, a local boy who seems to know a lot about the village, including the dark rumors surrounding the sacrificial ritual, a wealth-seeking ritual said to involve sacrificing a child\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunted by doubt, Eki begins to suspect that this graveyard visit might be somewhat related to the ritual, especially knowing his mother has been struggling financially since his father\u2019s death...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.poster.avif?t=1752670859\" width=752 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.webm?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/23698981711a62b6de76ade6f3ec7579.mp4?t=1752670859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who should you trust? Your mother, or Tomy? Play now to find out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit is an episodic, narrative-driven, walking sim horror game where you play as Eki, exploring a remote graveyard while uncovering unsettling truths about the child sacrifice ritual.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a narrative-driven, walking sim with light puzzle elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro PSX graphics: a love letter to the retro gaming era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a true story: every episode comes from a real submission by our community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Sometimes, your actions will result in different outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Indonesian cultural aspect: the setting, myth, and ritual are all drawn from real Indonesian folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A twist in the story.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Storytale"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/b9c1e9fe604af77696331e4dd3e52095dfbe63af/header.jpg?t=1752670859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731150/479906775/244c2b9e5b7b8da6a16430ed46b4568f7a67e24d/1750396549/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749993702","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731150/479906775/244c2b9e5b7b8da6a16430ed46b4568f7a67e24d/1750396549/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749993702","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3731150/479906775/244c2b9e5b7b8da6a16430ed46b4568f7a67e24d/1750396549/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749993702","id":257156979,"name":"(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit - Official Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/